class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>To the Honourable Lord Haverford Gist,<br>\n</p><p><br>\nYour reputation as a charitable nobleman is renowned far beyond the walls of Baldur's Gate - those walls that would preserve my family from the rage of the Absolute cult, could we but gain admittance. However, the Flaming Fist atthe South Span of Wyrm's Crossing are adamant in their refusalto let us in. I beg you to please use your influence to send a message to them allowing our passage. We would owe you our undying gratitude - and if you were in need of an experienced scribe, I would be willing to work for only the most nominal wages.<br>\n</p><p><br>\nScribe Gallaher Brym, in Rivington\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202517\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1347/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25494/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7347/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931293/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.674      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.674      1 -total\n 49.16%   19.503      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.73%   17.349     15 Template:Trim\n 23.46%    9.308      2 Template:Uid\n 16.34%    6.483      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.63%    5.408      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.61%    4.607      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.40%    4.524      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.62%    4.215      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:11386-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202517 and revision id 229500. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}